# Anything in here is copied into the app alongside the compiled game.

# flutter_additions.js is the Flutter native glue: it defines the saveAs()
# global that the game's export code calls, routes the Android back button back
# into the game, and replaces SugarCube's own loading screen -- it removes the
# stock spinner outright and draws our own, which is what the player looks at
# while the 50 MB story is delivered. It is injected ahead of the game's own
# scripts by scripts/prepare_flutter_assets.js.
#
# To see the loading screen without building and installing an APK, run
# ../.preview/build-preview.js and open the HTML it writes.

# Do not put anything else in here.